   valid earlier grant. The MIT text is recorded in licenses/MIT.txt.

3. External engines, libraries, examples, models, and assets retain their own
   copyright and license terms. They are not relicensed by SPIKE. See
   THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and the license files shipped with each component.

4. For material that has no applicable open-source license, no permission is
   granted by this notice beyond rights required by law. Such material is all
   rights reserved, but only to the extent that the applicable SPIKE licensor
   owns or is authorized to license it.

5. Contributor and asset provenance cannot be established from this workspace
   because its Git history is unavailable. A commercial release must not rely
   on this notice as proof of ownership. The release gate in LICENSING.md must
   be completed first.

This notice is not legal advice and is not a substitute for review by qualified
intellectual-property and commercial counsel.
